(text "EXECUTE" (rect 1424 -1024 1543 -1005)(font "AniMe Vision - MB_EN" (color 0 170 127)(font_size 12)))
(text "JMP, JAL, JR will be controlled by the Decode stage " (rect -240 -800 55 -787)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "so that subsequent instructions, are immediately" (rect -240 -784 44 -771)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "inserted into the pipline, with no \"bubbles\"." (rect -240 -768 11 -755)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "the Decode stage follows the fetch stage." (rect -240 -752 -2 -739)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "executed twice, but even so since its deterministic, it should" (rect 744 -1288 1093 -1275)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "stalling later stages has no effect, the instruction would be " (rect 744 -1304 1086 -1291)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "Inputs to stall a particular stage of the pipline." (rect 744 -1336 1010 -1323)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "PIPELINED CPU DESIGN" (rect -256 -1216 365 -1171)(font "AniMe Vision - MB_EN" (color 170 0 255)(font_size 28)))
(text "not create any problems." (rect 744 -1272 889 -1259)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "Its a given then that any preceding stages are also stalled," (rect 744 -1320 1082 -1307)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "FOR HALT" (rect 424 -1104 484 -1091)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "Output goes directly to the instruction register" (rect 2464 -176 2733 -163)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
